t: normal;\">航班量小幅下降，旅客量下降相对明显。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><br  /></span></p><p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"394\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\">从客座率看，12条航线大多仍在 </span><strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"365\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\">85%—95%</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><br  /></span></p><h2 data-section-id=\"zpnulr\" data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"421\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\">第19周最强航线：上海虹桥—深圳宝安，航班量第一，旅客量第一，同比增长0.28%，客座率95.42%</span></h2><p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"779\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\">第19周旅客量下降明显航线：广州白云-北京首都，旅客量环比下降12.11%，广州白云—上海浦东，旅客量环比下降 </span><strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1017\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\">11.85%</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\">。</span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100037363\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/phC3FYLrEUt3Zp3DXIRhiagX4EkNdpm3OibnfSKU1u1kq2rVezuD2Twbra3b7icoz1GqkGIZplGatvxY6Co8ia3lNuqLlKScLZqju98EXXkAR5Q/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" type=\"block\"></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100037364\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/phC3FYLrEUvaiasEX4mAXjibGDiao4SO9XbMMpX7fxTXcWZmqRkr1vsC9O7myDckduibZgtOXAguhmqTd4H9FerO3OdHAoqeGHkahX7GwFxdIbM/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" type=\"block\"></section><p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"120\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\">第19周商务航线票价整体回调，整体均价环比下降4.15%，但北京-深圳、北京-广州仍维持较高票价</span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100037365\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/phC3FYLrEUuo68zGmIBRBr1GRqmf0hykIkqOMibUCIs8U4g0NjH5iah1Q84lsib9QNLZcDzbIAbhbJFak9OCSPicEhQfYyN4ibPicd5qibseib1Zlh0/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" type=\"block\"></section><p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2750\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\">第19周支线航线TOP20合计执行航班2360班、运输旅客30.08万人次，环比均小幅下降，整体客座率约83.6%。从结构看，川藏高原、新疆疆内、内蒙古区域支线和旅游城市连接核心枢纽航线仍是支线市场主力。成都双流—拉萨贡嘎以213班、3.18万人次位居首位。呼和浩特—海拉尔、呼和浩特—通辽、和田—乌鲁木齐等航线旅客量增长较快。与此同时，广州—义乌、桂林—上海浦东、昆明— 德宏等航线旅客量下滑明显，部分航线客座率偏低。</span></p><section style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><br  /></span></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>",
